[05:34 - 05:43] SPEAKER_00: "Actually, the invention of these things allowed us to spend more time doing what we consider creative work and less time on pure survival and subsistence."
[05:43 - 05:45] SPEAKER_00: "And this opened up a lot of new jobs."
